WEBVTT

1
00:00:15.173 --> 00:00:17.394
together, everyone," Vig whispered.

2
00:00:18.174 --> 00:00:19.175
He glanced at Zann.

3
00:00:19.195 --> 00:00:22.796
"And make sure that dragon of yours behaves himself."

4
00:00:23.996 --> 00:00:28.738
"What a grump," Zann said as the rebel leader hurried toward the front of the small group.

5
00:00:29.759 --> 00:00:32.300
"Yeah." Perda stifled a yawn.

6
00:00:33.384 --> 00:00:37.547
It was very early, and Zann and his friends had been up talking most of the night.

7
00:00:38.368 --> 00:00:42.631
Zann had told them everything he'd seen in the palace, including the machine in the courtyard.

8
00:00:43.451 --> 00:00:46.994
Everyone wondered if it was the magic-sucking machine Gliss had heard about.

9
00:00:47.854 --> 00:00:51.237
Now they were marching into Wormwood, ready to test Fala's plan.

10
00:00:51.997 --> 00:00:57.241
She had spent the entire night working on the troll talisman, identifying each of the spells Morb had

11
00:00:57.301 --> 00:00:57.861
placed on it.

12
00:00:59.002 --> 00:01:01.704
Then she had eliminated all of them, one by one.

13
00:01:02.432 --> 00:01:04.133
"Do you really think this will work?"

14
00:01:04.533 --> 00:01:05.113
asked Zann.

15
00:01:05.793 --> 00:01:06.994
Fala looked at the talisman.

16
00:01:07.014 --> 00:01:11.576
"Infusing objects with a Remote Power spell is extremely difficult.

17
00:01:12.256 --> 00:01:14.977
But I learned from Teplo, and he's a master at it."

18
00:01:15.297 --> 00:01:16.018
Fala smiled.

19
00:01:16.038 --> 00:01:19.459
"Of course, until now I've only practiced on turnips."

20
00:01:21.220 --> 00:01:22.380
The group entered Wormwood.

21
00:01:22.740 --> 00:01:25.201
It was still early, and the whole place was quiet.

22
00:01:25.982 --> 00:01:27.763
None of the residents seemed to be awake yet.

23
00:01:27.783 --> 00:01:30.023
"Do you see any trolls?"

24
00:01:30.404 --> 00:01:31.004
Gliss whispered.

25
00:01:31.896 --> 00:01:33.036
"No," Perda said.

26
00:01:33.056 --> 00:01:34.717
"Maybe they're all sleeping."

27
00:01:34.737 --> 00:01:36.937
"I doubt it," Darb said.

28
00:01:36.957 --> 00:01:39.718
"Trolls don't sleep the way people do.

29
00:01:40.418 --> 00:01:43.019
They're not really smart enough to realize when they're tired.

30
00:01:43.699 --> 00:01:46.860
Trolls' brains just sort of shut down now and then throughout the day."

31
00:01:47.660 --> 00:01:48.300
Zann pointed.

32
00:01:48.320 --> 00:01:52.201
"Look!" Two trolls were emerging from behind a small group of huts.

33
00:01:53.022 --> 00:01:56.683
As soon as the trolls spotted Zann and Gliss, they charged toward them.

34
00:01:57.303 --> 00:01:59.783
A dull image of red hair floated above their heads.

35
00:02:01.820 --> 00:02:02.500
"Now!" Vig shouted.

36
00:02:03.321 --> 00:02:06.062
Fala held up the talisman, rubbing it between her hands.

37
00:02:06.082 --> 00:02:08.524
"Free!" she intoned.

38
00:02:09.284 --> 00:02:13.286
The trolls skidded to a halt, and the image of red hair disappeared.

39
00:02:14.067 --> 00:02:16.028
One troll looked at Zann, confused.

40
00:02:16.728 --> 00:02:21.291
The other troll let out a grunt—an image of troll gruel formed above its head.

41
00:02:22.131 --> 00:02:24.733
Soon the two trolls were searching the ground for food.

42
00:02:25.733 --> 00:02:29.816
When they didn't find any, they turned back toward Zann and began grunting angrily.

43
00:02:30.656 --> 00:02:32.117
"Uh-oh," said Darb.

44
00:02:32.137 --> 00:02:33.959
"Trolls don't like being hungry.

45
00:02:34.760 --> 00:02:37.902
Someone had better make some food for them before they get really mad."

46
00:02:38.663 --> 00:02:40.345
Shem quickly rubbed his hands together.

47
00:02:41.105 --> 00:02:44.548
A huge pot of steaming troll gruel appeared nearby.

48
00:02:45.249 --> 00:02:48.592
Both trolls let out howls of delight and ran to it.

49
00:02:48.612 --> 00:02:50.994
"Good." Vig sounded relieved.

50
00:02:51.714 --> 00:02:52.615
He glanced at Fala.

51
00:02:52.635 --> 00:02:57.760
"Does this mean all the trolls are free of Morb's influence, or just those two?"

52
00:02:58.548 --> 00:03:04.173
"My talisman should work on any trolls that are closer to it than to Morb's talisman," Fala replied.

53
00:03:04.193 --> 00:03:06.174
"That's amazing!"

54
00:03:06.575 --> 00:03:07.175
Perda whispered.

55
00:03:07.195 --> 00:03:12.119
"It'll be a lot easier to sneak into the palace now," said Zann.

56
00:03:12.139 --> 00:03:18.884
"With a little luck, we can find the dungeon and free the prisoners before Morb even realizes we're

57
00:03:18.924 --> 00:03:20.105
there," Vig said.

58
00:03:20.125 --> 00:03:24.689
"Maybe we can defeat Morb if we have help from all those powerful Reds."

59
00:03:25.590 --> 00:03:27.351
"Should we zap ourselves there?"

60
00:03:27.751 --> 00:03:28.292
Shem asked.

61
00:03:29.312 --> 00:03:32.533
"We'd better not," Fala said, looking at Zann and his friends.

62
00:03:32.553 --> 00:03:37.195
"Morb may still be tracking these kids, so they shouldn't use magic.

63
00:03:37.936 --> 00:03:41.517
Besides, we should save our energy in case we need it once we're in the palace."

64
00:03:41.537 --> 00:03:43.598
"Good point," Vig said.

65
00:03:43.618 --> 00:03:44.559
"Let's walk."

66
00:03:45.279 --> 00:03:47.380
It took about twenty minutes to reach the palace.

67
00:03:48.380 --> 00:03:53.642
On the way the group passed several more trolls, who were all busy eating or looking for food.

68
00:03:54.463 --> 00:03:56.964
None of them paid any attention to Gliss and Zann's red hair.

69
00:03:57.740 --> 00:04:01.363
When the group arrived at the palace courtyard, Zann didn't see any trolls.

70
00:04:01.383 --> 00:04:07.128
"I wonder if Morb has realized his trolls aren't working for him anymore," he commented.

71
00:04:07.148 --> 00:04:08.849
"I hope not."

72
00:04:09.249 --> 00:04:09.910
Fala frowned.

73
00:04:09.930 --> 00:04:12.872
"If he has, he might put up a Shield spell.

74
00:04:13.573 --> 00:04:15.654
That would make our task much more difficult."

75
00:04:16.735 --> 00:04:21.799
Zann didn't see a glowing green wall around the palace, or a wall of any other color either.

76
00:04:22.520 --> 00:04:24.441
"Can Shield spells be invisible?"

77
00:04:24.882 --> 00:04:25.342
Zann asked.

78
00:04:25.362 --> 00:04:27.464
"Yes," Gliss told him.

79
00:04:27.756 --> 00:04:30.238
"Weren't you paying attention when we learned that in class?"

80
00:04:30.258 --> 00:04:36.701
"There's only one way to test for a Shield spell," Vig declared, stepping toward the palace entrance.

81
00:04:37.702 --> 00:04:43.125
The others hurried after him, ducking behind some shrubs as Vig continued on his way toward the entrance.

82
00:04:44.025 --> 00:04:47.667
Zann saw him take a deep breath and then step across the threshold.

83
00:04:48.408 --> 00:04:51.650
A second later Vig poked his head back out and waved to the group.

84
00:04:51.670 --> 00:04:53.691
"No Shield spell!"

85
00:04:54.171 --> 00:04:55.232
Shem whispered to the others.

86
00:04:55.968 --> 00:04:57.829
The rest of the group followed Vig inside.

87
00:04:58.509 --> 00:05:00.109
They all paused in the entrance hall.

88
00:05:00.129 --> 00:05:02.950
"That was easy," said Perda.

89
00:05:03.610 --> 00:05:08.191
Zann was about to agree when he heard a strange squishing sound to his right.

90
00:05:08.972 --> 00:05:13.593
He turned to look and saw a purple, jellylike blob oozing toward them.

91
00:05:13.613 --> 00:05:15.734
"Uh-oh," said Zann.

92
00:05:15.754 --> 00:05:18.294
"Morb might not have put up a Shield spell.

93
00:05:18.994 --> 00:05:21.095
But it looks like he did leave a guard."

94
00:05:21.995 --> 00:05:23.476
"What is that thing?"

95
00:05:23.896 --> 00:05:24.456
Perda cried.

96
00:05:25.480 --> 00:05:27.181
"I don't know," Fala said.

97
00:05:27.201 --> 00:05:29.763
"I've never seen anything like it before."

98
00:05:30.604 --> 00:05:32.145
One of the rebels pulled out her sword.

99
00:05:32.165 --> 00:05:34.586
"Careful," Vig warned her.

100
00:05:34.606 --> 00:05:36.748
"We don't know what this thing might do."

101
00:05:37.548 --> 00:05:40.070
The woman reached out and poked the blob with her sword.

102
00:05:40.851 --> 00:05:46.054
Everyone gasped as the blob wrenched the sword from her hand and began absorbing it with a loud

103
00:05:46.174 --> 00:05:46.895
sucking sound.

104
00:05:47.996 --> 00:05:49.857
Zann could see the blob growing bigger.

105
00:05:50.557 --> 00:05:54.020
Grabbing the weapon, the woman tried to pull it back out, but it was no use.

106
00:05:54.836 --> 00:05:57.781
Her hand was getting dangerously close to the purple mass.

107
00:05:57.801 --> 00:05:59.324
"Let go!"

108
00:05:59.785 --> 00:06:00.386
Zann shouted.

109
00:06:01.147 --> 00:06:04.412
The woman released the sword and then jumped back as the blob lunged at her.

110
00:06:05.214 --> 00:06:08.579
Everyone took a step back as the blob oozed closer.
